Install jdk
install maven
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
java --version
mvn --version

git clone https://github.com/Alroyce/Java1.git  - cloning the project(https/ssh)

mvn validate - check the build prerequisites.
mvn compile  - compiles the source code identified for the build.
mvn test     - runs unit test for the compiled code.
mvn package  - assembles the compiled code into the binary build result.
mvn install  - shared the build result on the same machine.
mvn deploy   - publishes the build into the remote repository for the other projects to use.





